{"product":{"id":8748770361580,"title":"Cortech Ligature Resistant Wall Hooks – HookMax \/ HookMax+ \/ HM \/ HMP","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eCortech Ligature Resistant Wall Hooks\u003c\/strong\u003e hold clothing and towels in resident rooms, bathrooms, and common areas of behavioral healthcare and correctional facilities. The HookMax releases at a maximum load of 10 lbs and the HookMax+ at 20 lbs: the hook bends, the item or ligature slides off, and the hook returns to its shape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth hooks have a PC\/ABS core with a flexible TPU outer piece that helps prevent injury, and they release in all directions, so they can be placed close to furniture and doors. They come in five colors and are sold in packs of 5.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eModels:\u003c\/strong\u003e HookMax (HM) releases at a maximum 10 lb load; HookMax+ (HMP) releases at a maximum 20 lb load\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e PC\/ABS core with a flexible TPU outer piece\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.24”W×0.85”D×2.05”H (each hook)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRelease:\u003c\/strong\u003e Releases in all directions (360°), then returns to its shape\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTesting:\u003c\/strong\u003e Load release tests with a string release the HookMax at a maximum of 10 lbs and the HookMax+ at a maximum of 20 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMounting:\u003c\/strong\u003e Mount to a flat surface so the hook fits tightly against the wall\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Resistant to alcohol and most detergents\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e White, Gray, Black, Beige, or Magenta\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePackaging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sold in packs of 5. Price is per pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3-year warranty for the intended use; full warranty against manufacturing defects\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCountry of Manufacture:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed and produced in Sweden\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Models and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHM – HookMax, 5 Pack:\u003c\/strong\u003e HMWH - White, HMGY - Gray, HMBK - Black, HMBE - Beige, HMMG - Magenta\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHMP – HookMax+, 5 Pack:\u003c\/strong\u003e HMPWH - White, HMPGY - Gray, HMPBK - Black, HMPBE - Beige, HMPMG - Magenta\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe HookMax and HookMax+ suit rooms where residents need a place to hang clothing and towels without creating a ligature point.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTypical applications include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eResident rooms and bathrooms in behavioral healthcare facilities and psychiatric hospitals\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eCells and common areas in correctional facilities and jails\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eResidential treatment centers and shelters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Anchortex's \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/bh-hardware-for-behavioral-health-care-facilities\"\u003eHardware for Behavioral Health Care Facilities\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/prison-and-detention-hardware-and-equipment\"\u003ePrison \u0026amp; Detention Hardware \u0026amp; Equipment\u003c\/a\u003e collections for more ligature resistant hardware.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Cortech\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCortech manufactures durable molded furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, correctional institutions, law enforcement facilities, and homeless and emergency shelters. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/cortech-usa\"\u003eCortech Behavioral Health and Prison Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2024-12-17T11:19:59-05:00","handle":"cortech-hm-ligature-resistant-hookmax-wall-hook","updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:37:58-05:00","published_at":"2024-12-27T11:21:12-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"bh-behavioral-health-care-facility-furnishings, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-patient-rooms, bh-facility-hardware, cd-furn-cell, corrections-facility-hardware, cortech-usa, detention-cell-hardware, Suicide Prevention \u0026 Protection, washroom","variants":[{"id":46022752796908,"product_id":8748770361580,"title":"HMWH - HookMax, White, 5 Pack","price":"196.80","sku":"C601082-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"246.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"HMWH - HookMax, White, 5 Pack","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2024-12-17T11:19:59-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:37:58-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":2268,"image_id":null,"weight":5.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":68346355712236,"product_id":8748770361580,"title":"HMGY - HookMax, Gray, 5 Pack","price":"196.80","sku":"C601082-02","position":2,"compare_at_price":"246.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"HMGY - HookMax, Gray, 5 Pack","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T15:29:18-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:37:58-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":2268,"image_id":null,"weig